  <string name="phone_a11y_label">DSH Phone Control</string>
  <string name="phone_a11y_description">Works only when you ask DSH to do something on your phone: it reads the text on the current screen (and takes a screenshot when needed), then taps, types and swipes as you ask. Screen content is sent to the DeepSeek model you chose in DSH. While it works, a bar at the top of the screen lets you pause, stop or steer at any time; actions like sending, paying or deleting ask you first. DSH never fills in passwords or verification codes, never pays for you, and never changes system settings or permissions.</string>
